RE mark. Continue this recovery through the final moment; do not return to the opening mark or sustain a frozen tableau.\nLocked WIDE C_balcony audience camera, same existing battlements, moon backdrop and right curtain. Foreground stones remain rigid and in place, naturally occluding the lower gown; no hand braces against or passes through them. One opaque physical woman, two arms and hands, no flower, stem, leaf or prop. Soft neutral white light on skin and ivory fabric, blue confined to the set and trim. No magenta wash, flicker, ghost, duplicate limbs, pose dissolve, scale jump, camera movement, edit or background intruder. Preserve the exact original instrumental track and level. Quiet resting lips and breathing, no invented speech or silent singing; no new voice, music or Foley.",
